The site code (HTML / CSS / JavaScript / Python build scripts under
`assets/`, `scripts/`, `tests/`, and the page-template `*.html` files)
is also covered by the same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 licence for simplicity.

Author-attribution note:
  Bibliographic metadata about individual researchers (name, affiliations,
  publication record) is factual; the editorial summaries
  (`summary_*`, `data_used*`, `policy_relevance*`, bios) are the
  curatorial output of Gábor Békés (editor) with assistance from
  Anthropic's Claude. Contributions and corrections from named
  researchers are credited in commit messages and the
  `submissions/DONE/` archive.

